        "original_id": "a4bc1867-89ed-58da-a846-7edf36d9ae79",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nic Cester, Chris Cester, Cameron Muncey\n- Organizations: Jet\n- Products: Cold Hard Bitch, Rollover DJ, Get Born\n\nFacts:\n- Nic Cester was born on 6 July 1979.\n- Nic Cester is an Australian singer-songwriter and guitarist.\n- Nic Cester is the frontman of the rock band Jet alongside his younger brother Chris Cester.\n- Jet released its debut album Get Born on 14 September 2003.\n- Rollover DJ is a single by the Australian rock band Jet from the album Get Born.\n- Rollover DJ was the second single from Get Born, except in the United States where it was the third single after Cold Hard Bitch.\n- Cold Hard Bitch was released in March 2004.\n- Cold Hard Bitch was written by Jet band members Chris Cester, Nic Cester, and Cameron Muncey.",
